DESCRIPTION:In this election year - with the country in turmoil – there
 ’s only one comedian who can kill the mood even further… Nish Kumar - o
 ne of The Guardian and The Telegraph’s 50 Best Comedians of the 21st Cent
 ury - is back on tour with his brand new politically-charged stand-up show\
 , Nish\, Don’t Kill My Vibe . Expect jokes about climate collapse\, incom
 e inequality and the emotional sensation of being a British Indian man who 
 isn’t going to vote for a British Indian Prime Minister. As seen and hear
 d on The Mash Report \, Taskmaster \, Pod Save the UK \, Live at the Apollo
  \, Hold the Front Page and your favourite tabloid newspaper.\n\nReviews\n\
 n★★★★"The smartest\, and often the silliest\, political comic we’
 ve got" The Guardian\n\n★★★★ "Kumar is a commanding\, self-knowing 
 storyteller who threads big jokes through even the knottiest moments… roa
 ringly funny" The Times\n\nCouples Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n
 - $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protect
 ion\n\n**The Private Skybox Suite includes up to 10 tickets\, a $400 Food &
  Beverage voucher\, a personal server\, a private restroom\, and all gratui
 ty charges.\n\nAny additional food and drink costs above $400 will be bille
 d at the end of the show. The guest count can not exceed 10 people. All clu
 b policies and safety guidelines will be enforced. Please note that the sky
 box is on the second floor of our showroom\, and is NOT wheelchair accessib
 le.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the
  facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore inf
 o: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-nish-kumar/
